msgctxt "332"
msgid "Are you Asai, former employee of Café Alps?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Yeah... Who are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"Kazuma Kiryu. I wanna ask you about the murder\r\n"
"that happened at Café Alps six years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Oh, that. So what do you wanna know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "(Let's see. What to ask...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "You were at the café at the time of the murder, weren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I think I was closing the register. It was after we'd\r\n"
"closed for the night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"So you didn't go anywhere near the murder scene, the locker\r\n"
"room?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"Of course not. I mean, why would I? I was still working,\r\n"
"wasn't I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "(He's acting kind of funny...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"Do you know anything about the person seen running\r\n"
"from the scene of the crime?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "No, I don't know anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"I only found out a murder had taken place when Kinoshita-san\r\n"
"showed up looking as white as a sheet. I didn't see the\r\n"
"murderer at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Oh, but I did see Oda-san's body."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Ugh, I can still see it. Blech!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"(So Asai went into the locker room after the murderer\r\n"
"escaped, huh...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "Do you know anybody with a motive to kill Oda?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Well, you reap what you sow..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"I mean, it was bad enough he was always messing around\r\n"
"at the workplace, but going after another employee's woman?\r\n"
"Get a grip!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"You make it sound like he'd slept with other women at\r\n"
"the café before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "Yeah. I saw him hook up with another woman there once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "Another woman? Got a name for her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I think her last name was Saitoh. I guess she was\r\n"
"dating Oda-san at the time of the murder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"I don't see anybody named Saitoh listed among the people\r\n"
"related to the case."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid ""
"She'd already quit the café by that time. I heard she still\r\n"
"hung around Oda-san, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "(So <Color:7>Oda was dating somebody at the time<Color:Default>...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "You got <Color:8>Asai's Testimony<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid ""
"Your fingerprints weren't found on the murder weapon. Isn't\r\n"
"that strange, seeing as you were one of the waiters?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid ""
"I just didn't like doing the ashtrays. I always left that to\r\n"
"other people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"So it's pretty natural my fingerprints wouldn't be on it,\r\n"
"I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid ""
"This job is pretty boring, so thanks for helping me kill\r\n"
"some time. You can ask me more whenever you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid "Are you sure there isn't anything else you wanna tell me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid ""
"What do you mean? It's not like I have anything to hide...\r\n"
"Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid ""
"(Asai sounds like he knows more. I just don't have enough\r\n"
"information right now to get it out of him.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid "(I should talk to him again when I know more.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "By the way... Do you remember Imagawa?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid "Imagawa? Sounds familiar..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid "Your coworker from Café Alps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid "Oh, Mr. Gloomy? Yeah, I remember him now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid ""
"Imagawa says he had things stolen from his locker. You\r\n"
"know anything about that, Asai?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid "What, you think I had something to do with it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid ""
"Look, I'm not judging you. I'm just trying to find out\r\n"
"what you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid ""
"Well, I might've tried to make a quick buck or two off\r\n"
"him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "All I took was a wallet and some CDs I sold off later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid "I'm just trying to find out what you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1088"
msgid ""
"But you really think I did it, though, don't you...?\r\n"
"Okay, you got me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid "I <Italic>did</Italic> do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1124"
msgid ""
"I was just trying to make a quick buck or two... All I took\r\n"
"was a wallet and some CDs I sold off later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1148"
msgid "Anything else?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "Huh? Like what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172"
msgid "You didn't steal Imagawa's uniform?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1184"
msgid ""
"Uniform? How would I make any money off of that? All I stole\r\n"
"was his wallet and CDs, that's all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1196"
msgid ""
"(So <Color:7>that's all Asai took<Color:Default>, huh? Maybe the police "
"really did\r\n"
"take the uniform...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1220"
msgid "You got <Color:8>Asai's Testimony 2<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1256"
msgid "I wanna ask you about the murder at Café Alps six years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1268"
msgid "This job is boring me to tears, so ask away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1280"
msgid "(Let's see. What to ask...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1292"
msgid "Ask for Their Alibi"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1304"
msgid "Ask About Witness Statements"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1316"
msgid "Ask About the Motive"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1328"
msgid "Ask About the Fingerprints"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1340"
msgid "Stop Asking Questions"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1352"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1364"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

